
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>HANNAN LUXES | Tailored Luxury Fashion</title>
<meta name="description" content="HANNAN LUXES: suits, shirts and corporate wear for men and women, with shoes, bags and accessories.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --plum:#2A1537;
  --purple:#5B2A86;
  --lilac:#E8E1F0;
  --grey:#8B8893;
  --mist:#F3F2F5;
  --ink:#2B2830;
  --white:#FFFFFF;
  --serif:'Cormorant Garamond','Times New Roman',Georgia,serif;
  --sans:'Jost','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:72px}
body{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:300;color:var(--ink);background:var(--white);line-height:1.7;font-size:17px}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--purple);outline-offset:3px}
.wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px}

/* Navigation */
header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;background:rgba(255,255,255,.96);border-bottom:1px solid var(--lilac);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:72px}
.logo{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:1.4rem;letter-spacing:.22em;color:var(--plum)}
nav ul{display:flex;gap:34px;list-style:none}
nav a{font-size:.95rem;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--ink);padding-bottom:4px;border-bottom:1px solid transparent;transition:border-color .2s,color .2s}
nav a:hover{color:var(--purple);border-color:var(--purple)}

/* Hero */
.hero{background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--plum) 0%,#3F1F5A 55%,var(--purple) 100%);color:var(--white);text-align:center;padding:150px 0 140px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hero::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:28px;border:1px solid rgba(232,225,240,.28);pointer-events:none}
.hero h1{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(2.8rem,9vw,6.4rem);letter-spacing:.2em;line-height:1.05;padding-left:.2em}
.rule{width:64px;height:1px;background:var(--grey);margin:34px auto}
.hero p{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(1.25rem,3vw,1.7rem);color:var(--lilac);max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 46px;padding:0 20px}
.btn{display:inline-block;padding:15px 40px;font-size:.95rem;letter-spacing:.12em;border:1px solid var(--white);color:var(--white);transition:background .25s,color .25s}
.btn:hover{background:var(--white);color:var(--plum)}
.btn.solid{background:var(--purple);border-color:var(--purple)}
.btn.solid:hover{background:var(--plum);border-color:var(--plum);color:var(--white)}

/* Sections */
section{padding:110px 0}
h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3rem);color:var(--plum);line-height:1.2;text-align:center}
.lead{max-width:620px;margin:20px auto 0;text-align:center;color:var(--grey)}

/* Collections */
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:22px;margin-top:64px}
.panel{aspect-ratio:3/4;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;padding:28px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;color:var(--white);transition:transform .35s}
.panel:hover{transform:translateY(-6px)}
.panel .mark{position:absolute;top:8px;right:18px;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:7.5rem;line-height:1;opacity:.14}
.panel h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;font-size:1.7rem;line-height:1.2}
.panel p{font-size:.92rem;margin-top:6px;opacity:.88;line-height:1.5}
.p1{background:linear-gradient(170deg,#4A2370,var(--plum))}
.p2{background:linear-gradient(170deg,#A5A2AC,#6F6C77)}
.p3{background:linear-gradient(170deg,var(--purple),#3A1B55)}
.p4{background:linear-gradient(170deg,#7C7985,#4A4752)}

/* About */
.about{background:var(--mist)}
.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:80px;align-items:center}
.about h2{text-align:left}
.about p{margin-top:22px;color:#4C4954}
.about-box{aspect-ratio:1/1;background:var(--plum);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative}
.about-box::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:18px;border:1px solid var(--grey)}
.about-box span{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(4rem,12vw,8rem);color:var(--lilac);letter-spacing:.1em;padding-left:.1em}

/* Promises */
.promises{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:56px;margin-top:64px;text-align:center}
.promises h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--purple)}
.promises p{margin-top:10px;color:var(--grey);font-size:.98rem}

/* Contact */
.contact{background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--plum),#3F1F5A);color:var(--white);text-align:center}
.contact h2{color:var(--white)}
.contact .lead{color:var(--lilac)}
.details{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:70px;margin:56px 0 48px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.details div{min-width:220px}
.details small{display:block;color:var(--grey);font-size:.85rem;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-bottom:6px}
.details a{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;border-bottom:1px solid transparent;transition:border-color .2s}
.details a:hover{border-color:var(--lilac)}

/* Footer */
footer{background:#1F102A;color:var(--grey);text-align:center;padding:40px 0;font-size:.9rem}
footer .logo{display:block;color:var(--lilac);font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:8px}

/* Responsive */
@media (max-width:900px){
  .grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:48px}
  .about-box{max-width:360px;margin:0 auto;width:100%}
  .promises{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}
}
@media (max-width:640px){
  body{font-size:16px}
  nav ul{gap:18px}
  nav a{font-size:.85rem}
  .logo{font-size:1.1rem;letter-spacing:.16em}
  section{padding:80px 0}
  .hero{padding:110px 0 100px}
  .hero::before{inset:14px}
  .grid{gap:14px}
  .panel{padding:18px}
  .panel h3{font-size:1.35rem}
  .panel .mark{font-size:5rem}
  .details{gap:36px}
}
@media (max-width:460px){
  .nav{flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:2px;height:84px}
  html{scroll-padding-top:90px}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  html{scroll-behavior:auto}
  *{transition:none!important}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap nav">
    <a href="#top" class="logo">HANNAN LUXES</a>
    <nav aria-label="Main">
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#collections">Collections</a></li>
        <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="top">

  <div class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>HANNAN LUXES</h1>
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <p>Refined tailoring and accessories for men and women of the world.</p>
      <a href="#collections" class="btn">Explore the collections</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section id="collections">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>The Collections</h2>
      <p class="lead">Corporate wear cut with precision, and the finishing pieces that complete it.</p>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="panel p1">
          <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">S</span>
          <h3>Suits</h3>
          <p>Tailored suits for men and women.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="panel p2">
          <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">S</span>
          <h3>Shirts</h3>
          <p>Crisp shirts and corporate wear for every day of the week.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="panel p3">
          <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">F</span>
          <h3>Shoes</h3>
          <p>Polished footwear that finishes the look.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="panel p4">
          <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">B</span>
          <h3>Bags &amp; More</h3>
          <p>Bags and accessories made to travel.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="about" class="about">
    <div class="wrap about-grid">
      <div>
        <h2>About Hannan Luxes</h2>
        <p>HANNAN LUXES is a fashion house dedicated to modern, classic dressing. We design and produce suits, shirts and corporate wear for men and women, and complete every wardrobe with shoes, bags and other accessories.</p>
        <p>Our work is guided by clean lines, fine fabrics and careful finishing, so that you look composed in any boardroom, in any city.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-box" aria-hidden="true"><span>HL</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="promise">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Our Promise</h2>
      <div class="promises">
        <div>
          <h3>Precise Tailoring</h3>
          <p>Every garment is cut and finished with attention to fit and form.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Quality Materials</h3>
          <p>Fine fabrics and leathers chosen to look elegant and last.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Timeless Style</h3>
          <p>Classic designs that stay relevant season after season.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="contact">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p class="lead">Ask about our collections, place an order or book a fitting. We will reply promptly.</p>
      <div class="details">
        <div>
          <small>Phone</small>
          <a href="tel:0123456789">0123456789</a>
        </div>
        <div>
          <small>Email</small>
          <a href="mailto:HannanLuxes@gmail.com">HannanLuxes@gmail.com</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="mailto:HannanLuxes@gmail.com" class="btn solid">Send us an email</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="logo">HANNAN LUXES</span>
    &copy; <span id="year">2026</span> HANNAN LUXES. All rights reserved.
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
  document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
</script>
</body>
</html>
